<Positioned left="760.00" top="628.00" width="250.00" height="40.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="13" color="#1F2A33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">以降水区分</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="760.00" top="674.00" width="250.00" height="30.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="10.5" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">与层云外形相似，但层云不产生持续降水；有持续降水即为雨层云</Text></Container></Positioned>
