<Positioned left="86.00" top="1096.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 由增厚的高层云发展而来，或发展盛的积雨云铺展增厚而成</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="86.00" top="1124.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 云底随降水持续降低——常被误认为低云（天气图上视为中云）</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="86.00" top="1152.00" width="460.00" height="26.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="12" color="#5A6B78" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">· 与层云之别：以是否产生持续降水区分</Text></Container></Positioned>
